From bbb37458d4e2a9c6470bb6a70a0a38ca42ac318f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mickhuang <mickhuang@ami.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:23:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] board: ibex_ast2700: Add PHY3/XHCI USB IP initialization for
 A1

Port SCU0 USB routing (usb_func_ctrl, PHY3/XHCI, BEHCI EOF timing)
and the matching pcie0/pcie1 ehci/xhci enable properties, restricted
to AST2700-A1: PortA = EHCI_VHUB + XHCI_PHY, PortB = XHCI_VHUB only.

Ported from aspeed-zephyr-project commit e2aba300c58e ("usb: Add more
SoC0 USB IP initialization").

Signed-off-by: mickhuang <mickhuang@ami.com>
---
 arch/riscv/dts/ast2700-ibex.dts               |   3 -
 .../include/asm/arch-ast2700/scu_ast2700.h    |  12 +-
 .../include/asm/arch-ast2700/usb_ast2700.h    |  36 +-
 board/aspeed/ibex_ast2700/ibex_ast2700.c      | 339 ++++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 345 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

